<BaseLayout title="LockedIn: LinkedIn Writing Assistant | Will Chai" description="LockedIn was a GPT based writing project by William Chai for revising LinkedIn profiles and experience descriptions." path="/lockedin-gpt-powered-linkedin-profile-optimizer/"><div class="pageShell"><SiteHeader current="projects" /><main id="main" class="pageMain"><article class="archiveRecord"><p>Project archive · William Chai</p><h1>LockedIn: LinkedIn Writing Assistant</h1><section><h2>The project</h2><p>LockedIn was a writing assistant project by William Chai for LinkedIn profiles. It helped users revise About sections and experience descriptions using information about their background, responsibilities and work.</p></section><section><h2>Working with experience</h2><p>The assistant used a conversational workflow to gather details and prepare suggested wording. Users could review drafts and adapt them to their own experience. The project explored how structured instructions could support professional writing.</p></section><p><a href="mailto:me@willchai.com">Contact William Chai</a> · <a href="/projects/">Current projects</a> · <a href="/resume/">Résumé</a></p></article></main><SiteFooter /></div></BaseLayout>
